<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112697" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῡσί-ζοος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, as
		epith. of earth, prob. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>producing</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζέα, αἶα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.243
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.301
			</span></i>, Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.67
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.63
				</span></i>
			; but reinterpreted as from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωή
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζόη</span>), <i>producing life,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυσιζόου . . γένος Ζηνός</span> prob.
			in <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				584
			</span></i> (lyr., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυσίζοον</span> cod.M); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.383.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tryph.
					77
				</span></i>
			, etc.</div>
